# Governs what the shyftex-api deployment uploads. The project's Vercel
# rootDirectory is `server/`, so everything the function needs lives under
# server/api and server/src — the Expo app at the repo root is dead weight.
#
# Patterns are anchored with a leading slash on purpose: a bare `src/` would also
# match server/src and break the function build.

# Expo app / repo-root artefacts (not part of the API)
/src/
/android/
/assets/
/.expo/
/dist/
/app.html
/app.json
/babel.config.js
/jest.config.js
/eslint.config.mjs
/serve.js
/tunel.sh
/iniciar.sh
/docker-compose.yml
/Dockerfile
/render.yaml
/railway.json
/CLAUDE.md
/AGENTS.md
/DECISIONS.md
/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md
/README.md
/LICENSE
/coverage/
/android

# Credentials — must never leave the machine
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.vercel/
**/secrets/
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Installed dependencies and build output are reproduced inside the build
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
